(11,651 real changes made, 11,651 to missing)
(11,370 real changes made, 11,370 to missing)
(11,437 real changes made, 11,437 to missing)
(11,587 real changes made, 11,587 to missing)
(11,595 real changes made, 11,595 to missing)
(11,672 real changes made, 11,672 to missing)
(11,676 real changes made, 11,676 to missing)
(11,469 real changes made, 11,469 to missing)
(11,422 real changes made, 11,422 to missing)
(830 real changes made, 830 to missing)
(996 real changes made, 996 to missing)
(782 real changes made, 782 to missing)
(928 real changes made, 928 to missing)
(1,984 real changes made, 1,984 to missing)
(714 real changes made, 714 to missing)
(550 real changes made, 550 to missing)
(11,677 real changes made, 11,677 to missing)
(11,685 real changes made, 11,685 to missing)
(12,014 real changes made, 12,014 to missing)
(16,872 real changes made, 16,872 to missing)
(16,873 real changes made, 16,873 to missing)

. 
. gen weekly_nonpaid = pli0011 + pli0012_h + pli0016_h + pli0019_h ///
>         + pli0022_h + pli0031_h + 5*pli0040 + 5*pli0043_h + 5*pli0044_h ///
>         + 5*pli0046 + 5*pli0049_h + pli0055 + pli0057
(15,536 missing values generated)

. 
. * Everyone only has 168 hours in a week
. replace weekly_nonpaid = 168 if weekly_nonpaid > 168 & weekly_nonpaid != .
(129 real changes made)

